(text "J1132 is the 3.3 V UART debug port: RX / GND / TX solder pads.\nPower the board from its host port before using UART;\ndo not connect an adapter supply." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 177.8 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5f88d2e0-5163-46c0-906b-ca648ac59e9b"))
(text "Management buses" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7d13560-3157-4ad2-9655-434e6e5d6ef7"))
(text "I2C mux address 0x70; select one channel at a time. Channels 0-4 are targets 1-5; channel 5 is the host CC controller.\nChannel 6 reaches the hub strap/status pins without pull-ups; autonomous ROM boot takes priority.\nChannel 7 is the optional display and charging-input control bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff0ef535-5fde-41a5-b007-752f0bf8424b"))

)
